  /// in the Amazon Cognito Developer Guide . The ClientMetadata value is
  /// passed as input to the functions for only the following triggers: Pre
  /// signup Pre authentication User migration This request also invokes the
  /// functions for the following triggers, but doesn't pass ClientMetadata :
  /// Post authentication Custom message Pre token generation Create auth
