  /// The date when the user import job was completed.
  pub completion_date: Time? = None
  /// The status of the user import job. One of the following: Created - The
  /// job was created but not started. Pending - A transition state. You have
  /// started the job, but it has not begun importing users yet. InProgress -
  /// The job has started, and users are being imported. Stopping - You have
  /// stopped the job, but the job has not stopped importing users yet.
  /// Stopped - You have stopped the job, and the job has stopped importing
  /// users. Succeeded - The job has completed successfully. Failed - The job
  /// has stopped due to an error. Expired - You created a job, but did not
  /// start the job within 24-48 hours. All data associated with the job was
