  /// Web Services Region that you want, the Amazon Cognito user pool uses an
  /// Identity and Access Management (IAM) role in your Amazon Web Services
  /// account.
  pub sms_configuration: SmsConfigurationType? = None
  /// The tags that are assigned to the user pool. A tag is a label that you
  /// can apply to user pools to categorize and manage them in different ways,
  /// such as by purpose, owner, environment, or other criteria.
  pub user_pool_tags: Map[Str, Str]? = None
  /// The reason why the SMS configuration can't send the messages to your
